4e87069a-1a33-4566-832e-e81b8336d9d5	Barbell Smash: Quads	Roll barbell sleeve on quads.	{Quads}	{Barbell}	t	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Advanced	{"Sit on the floor with a barbell in front of you.","Position your quads on top of the barbell.","Apply gentle pressure by leaning forward slightly.","Roll the barbell along your quads, applying pressure to tight areas.","Hold on areas that feel particularly tight.","Continue rolling for the desired duration."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
9d9db2d9-ef8b-43a5-a2f6-355b3b6855a3	Zercher Hold	Static hold bar in elbows.	{Core,"Upper Back"}	{Barbells}	t	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Intermediate	{"Position a barbell in the crook of your elbows.","Stand up, supporting the weight with your arms.","Hold this position statically, engaging your core and upper back.","Keep your core engaged and maintain an upright posture.","This exercise develops incredible isometric strength.","Hold for the desired duration.","The Zercher position provides a unique challenge."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
593213ad-c886-4eae-b478-fa8491defbd8	Zottman Preacher Curl	Zottman curl on preacher bench.	{Biceps,Forearms}	{Dumbbells,"Preacher Curl Bench"}	f	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Intermediate	{"Sit at a preacher curl bench with a dumbbell in one hand.","Rest your arm on the pad with your arm extended, palm facing up.","Curl the dumbbell up by bending your arm.","At the top, rotate your wrist so your palm faces down.","Lower the dumbbell with your palm facing down.","Rotate your wrist back to palm up at the bottom.","This combines a bicep curl with a reverse curl, targeting both biceps and forearms.","Complete all reps on one arm before switching."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
716a7749-e1a2-4c01-8fe5-b920d47da28f	Ab Crunch Machine	A machine-based abdominal exercise performed in a seated position. You crunch your torso forward against resistance, targeting the rectus abdominis with controlled movement.	{Abs}	{"Ab Crunch Machine"}	f	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Beginner	{"Sit in the ab crunch machine and adjust the seat height so the pad sits comfortably on your upper chest.","Place your feet flat on the foot platform and grip the handles.","Crunch your torso forward by contracting your abs, bringing your chest toward your knees.","Squeeze your abs at the top of the movement.","Slowly return to the starting position with control."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	4.0	\N
e7b8fd0c-ba2f-4fde-91fb-e93a0465478e	Penetration Step (Shot)	Step deep to takedown.	{Quads,Glutes}	{}	f	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Intermediate	{"Stand in a fighting stance.","Step deep forward with one leg, penetrating your opponent's space.","Use this step to set up a takedown or shot.","Keep your core engaged and maintain balance.","This movement develops explosive leg power and coordination.","Practice on both sides."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
deb6a3fb-a106-41af-b050-bcbdbadd2006	Warrior I	High lunge, back heel down, arms up.	{Glutes,Quads}	{}	t	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Beginner	{"Start in a lunge position with one leg forward.","Keep your back heel on the ground and your front knee aligned over your ankle.","Raise your arms overhead, palms facing each other.","Hold this position, feeling a stretch in your hip flexor and a contraction in your glutes.","Keep your core engaged and your torso upright.","Switch legs and repeat."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
396c48ea-f041-417d-8e92-8f8cb25fb99f	Warrior II	Wide stance, arms T-shape, gaze over front hand.	{Glutes,Quads,Delts}	{}	t	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Beginner	{"Stand with your feet wide apart, one foot turned out.","Bend your front knee, aligning it over your ankle.","Extend your arms out to your sides in a T shape.","Turn your head to look over your front hand.","Hold this position, feeling a stretch in your inner thighs.","Keep your core engaged and your back leg straight.","Switch sides and repeat."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
37b2c56b-6c21-45ea-89aa-4e355d2b614b	Wrist Curl	Curl wrists upwards with palms facing up.	{Forearms}	{Dumbbells,Barbells}	f	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	2025-11-28 06:22:04.510153+00	Beginner	{"Sit on a bench holding a dumbbell or barbell with your palm facing up.","Rest your forearm on your thigh with your wrist hanging off.","Curl your wrist up by flexing your forearms.","Continue curling until your wrist is fully flexed.","Lower your wrist back to the starting position with control.","This exercise strengthens your forearm flexors.","Complete all reps on one arm before switching if using dumbbells."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	3.5	\N
